ormats in Apache Spark, including built-in sources, JDBC, and cloud storage.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/08-data-sources-and-formats","index":7,"slug":"08-data-sources-and-formats"},{"title":"Spark SQL","excerpt":"A guide to using Spark SQL for querying structured data, including SQL queries, UDFs, and performance optimization.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/09-spark-sql-dataframe","index":8,"slug":"09-spark-sql-dataframe"},{"title":"Spark Structured Streaming","excerpt":"A guide to using Spark Streaming for real-time data processing, including DStreams, Structured Streaming, and fault tolerance.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/10-spark-strucured-streaming","index":9,"slug":"10-spark-strucured-streaming"},{"title":"Spark Unstructured Streaming","excerpt":"A guide to using Spark Streaming for real-time data processing, including DStreams, Structured Streaming, and fault tolerance.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/11-spark-unstructured-streaming","index":10,"slug":"11-spark-unstructured-streaming"},{"title":"Performance Tuning","excerpt":"A guide to performance tuning techniques for Apache Spark, including memory management, serialization, and resource allocation.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/12-performance-tuning","index":11,"slug":"12-performance-tuning"},{"title":"Machine Learning with MLlib","excerpt":"A guide to using MLlib for machine learning tasks in Apache Spark, including data preparation, feature engineering, and model deployment.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/14-machine-learning-with-mllib","index":12,"slug":"14-machine-learning-with-mllib"},{"title":"Graph Processing with GraphX","excerpt":"A guide to using GraphX for graph processing tasks in Apache Spark, including graph creation, manipulation, and algorithms.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/15-graph-processing-with-graphx","index":13,"slug":"15-graph-processing-with-graphx"},{"title":"Advanced Spark Concepts","excerpt":"An in-depth exploration of advanced concepts in Apache Spark, including the Catalyst optimizer, Tungsten execution engine, and adaptive query execution.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/16-advanced-spark-concepts","index":14,"slug":"16-advanced-spark-concepts"},{"title":"Deployment and Production","excerpt":"A guide to deploying and managing Apache Spark applications in production environments, including cluster deployment modes, resource management, and security.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/17-deployment-and-production","index":15,"slug":"17-deployment-and-production"},{"title":"Real-world Applications","excerpt":"Exploring real-world applications of Apache Spark, including ETL processing, data lake architecture, and real-time analytics.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/18-real-world-applications","index":16,"slug":"18-real-world-applications"},{"title":"Integration with Big Data Ecosystem","excerpt":"Exploring Apache Spark's integration with the broader big data ecosystem, including Hadoop, Hive, Kafka, and Delta Lake.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/19-integration-with-big-data-ecosystem","index":17,"slug":"19-integration-with-big-data-ecosystem"},{"title":"Best Practices and Design Patterns","excerpt":"A guide to best practices and design patterns for developing Apache Spark applications, including project structure, testing, and error handling.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/20-best-practices-and-design-patterns","index":18,"slug":"20-best-practices-and-design-patterns"},{"title":"Hands-on Projects","excerpt":"Practical hands-on projects to apply Apache Spark concepts and build real-world data processing solutions.","createdAt":"2021-05-03","author":"manoj-pawar","permalink":"/posts/bigdata/apache-spark/21-hands-on-projects","index":19,"slug":"21-hands-on-projects"}],"index":15},"__N_SSG":true}